<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- BLANK based on TPB 99</book>
  <para style="ide"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="h"/>
  <para style="toc3">Kl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kl</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kolosi</para>
  <para style="mt">Polue Kolosi xosa nakau xayawotai</para>
  <para style="imt">Akereki Kuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolosi paiya kire erewese nu propinsi Esia xosa purina. Nu erewese Epesesi tomuroni purinana xiri xetauro puratixe. Polu nukoini Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai nikau saina Kolosi erewese sarepu xuwewotai. Pana nu Epesesi puroyai yause xosa apimi xesanikati xouneri pa propinsipo kirereira masa xosa saina teneai. Kireu xesanikati Kolosi xowoneai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolosi nikau xonikisu kireu apimie pororinikepurexeri, Polue kuna iyeserina, ninipo xonikisu sokisokiwopinerire nakau xesariniketai. Nue ipaki kunauna Kristusu nu xokupa sapipo tapa. Kristusu kirenie siko xiyeri tisikepina itouna kireu imerei sini tisikepuwatixe. Ninie xetauroni kutu yatasikeria sini Kristusu wetepu. Xoiteue Kristusu xosa xokupa sapi iyareyai xati Kristusupo saina xosa Xoiteue xokupa sapi xiyeri tepurexina. Kristusue sikoreira purati, sini oma xuiapu sainuku Kristusu nukou kapiani tainuku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Polue mua nakau xayauna aimore apu tinikati, ninie Kolosi nakau tineri xowoneai. Xoka kireni paiya, nu Tikikusi. Xoka axiri apu paiya, nu Onesimusi, pa apue Pilemoni xosa nakau xayawoyai xati nure Polue xokupa kuna kunawoyai.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Kristusu nu xokupa sapi nikau tapuniki xati, Xoiteupo xokupa ekeoma xeika kapia xeika nu xosa koxineri</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="COL 1:1-3:4">Kl 1.1—3.4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:1">Ep 1.1</ref></char></note> Polu, ye Kristusu Yesusupo tianuwopi. Xoiteu nukoini ye xouweina Yesusupo tianuwopi tumuyeretai. Yeu xatai Timotino <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>sinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Ro 1.7</ref></char></note> mua nakau tini Xoiteupo xuiapu Kolosi erewese purikiriai xosa xayaritikinuku, paiya tini xatasikimana ukusikimanae Kristusu xosa xotikisukiriai xosa. Sikou Emisiki Xoiteue tinire xousuaxati xouwetikatia tinipo xotikikemu yoroni purakuai.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kolosi kinie Yesusure xiri xonikisuneri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Sini kunikuninua paiya<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:16">Ep 1.16</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:3">Pl 1.3</ref></char></note>, sipesi tinire nanunanunua Xoiteu eiyaseurounua, nu sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusupo Omo. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="COL 1:4-6"/>Sinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:8">Mk 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">16.15</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yo 15.16</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:15">Ep 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:2">3.2</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:8">2 Ti 4.8</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:5">Pm 5</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 6:10">Ip 6.10</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:4">1 Pi 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:12">5.12</ref></char></note> muanumu kuna tinire iyesikiria, asinaku kunapu suau kuna tini xosa koati tinie iyeserinuku, pa asinaku sapi Xoiteue tini akituworitikina mena xouro iyarati purotai tepure tini xotikisukiriai. Pa xati tinie Kristusu Yesusure xiri xotikisunuku Xoiteupo xokupa xuiapu xosa xotikikemu tinikirounuku. Xokupa wese wese ninie mua asinaku kuna uteiwopi saina teri, xokupa xuiapue xonikisuneri taineri, ninipo kapia asinaku xetai. Ximuximu akereki asau xosa Xoiteue xousuaxati xouwesiketai asinaku kuna tinie iyesinuku xiri sipawari, panumu kapiani tini xopu xosa yaraxetai. <verse eid="COL 1:4-6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Epaprasie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Kl 4.12</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pm 23</ref></char></note> mua asinaku kunapu kuna tini taitaitikati, tinie sipauweikiriai. Epaprasi nu Kristusupo asinaku saina apu. Nu sinipo saina emesiki xati, sinie nu xiri xosikieurounuku. Nue tini tianitikina Kristusupo saina atinani tirouna. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Xoiteupo xuiapu xiri xouwenikepi kapia Xoiteupo Supo Youyae tini tikeyaire nue sini kasietai.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue Kolosi kini sokisoki nikepinaure Polue kunikuniwotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Ro 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:5">1 Ko 1.5</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:8-9">Ep 1.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:15-17">1.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:10">5.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:17">5.17</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:9">Pl 1.9</ref></char></note> ximuximu akereki asau xosauni, tinipo asinaku kapiaure iyeserinua, Xoiteue tini xouwetiketai atinarini kutu sipawakuaire sipesi sinie kunikuninua Xoiteue tianitikepinaure kotourounua. Kakikiri Xoiteupo Supo Youyae asinaku asinaku sipa xeika nanunanu xeika tikatia paie tini xosa xiri xokopexepina. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Kakati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yo 15.16</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:10">Ep 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:1">4.1</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:27">Pl 1.27</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:1">1 Ts 4.1</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:21">Ip 13.21</ref></char></note> tinie Kokaipapu xuiapuni kutu nikau kapiarei texaria, tinipo xokupa kapia xouwewopina. Kakatia tinie xokupa asinaku asinaku saina takuai. Kakinari Xoiteu sipaunaria, pa sipae pani sipesi kokaipa xepina. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Sinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:19">Ep 1.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:16">3.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:2">4.2</ref></char></note> ipaki kunikunirounua, nukou kokaipa sokisoki asinakuni xosa, Xoiteue tini xokupa sokisoki tikatia, tini sokisoki tumunari xokupa xu xemenaria, peuni purinari xu xuwexepineri yause yakuwakuai. Kakatia tinie nimaririeinari <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Emisiki eiyasewakuai<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:11">Ep 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:18">1.18</ref></char></note>. Nukoe tini akituworitikeyai asinaku asinaku sapi takuaire, nukoe kakati tini asinaku asinaku kapia taikiniai. Xoiteupo xokupa xuiapu nini nukou memeremu xosa puroteneai xeika pa asinaku asinaku sapi tini takuai. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:53">Lu 22.53</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:2">Ep 2.2</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:12">1 Ts 2.12</ref>;<ref loc="2PE 1:11">2 Pi 1.11</ref></char></note> ukumupo sokisokipo iru xosa purikiri, nue xiyeri tisikina nukou Nonopu kini xosa iyaisikeretai, pa Nono paiya nukoe xiri xouweurouna. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>Xoiteupo Nono nukoe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:6-7">Ep 1.6-7</ref></char></note> sini xiyeri isayasikina sikou xokupa xunu weterisikeyai.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Kristusupo kapia xeika saina xeikaure kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yo 1.18</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 4:4">2 Ko 4.4</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:3">Ip 1.3</ref></char></note> Xoiteu xekopusie itou xuwe, pana Xoiteupo Nono nu Xoiteu nuko sieni. Nu Xoiteupo akereki Nono xati, Xoiteu nukoe xokupa sapi iyareyai xiri tapaxi purina. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Pa Nonopu xuporei<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yo 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:10">1.10</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:38">Ro 8.38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:36">11.36</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:2">Ip 1.2</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:10">2.10</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:22">1 Pi 3.22</ref></char></note> Xoiteue xokupa sapi mena xouro xeika ouro xeika xosa iyareyai. Nue xokupa sapi xekopu xuweu xeika xekeurounuku sapi xeika iyareyai, paiya xetauxetau sokisoki xenikorokoro xeika sokisoki youya xeika xokupa sapi sokisoki tuku xeika iyareyai. Nukoe xokupa sapi nukouni iyareyai. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Mua xokupa sapi putawopu xuweu yauseni<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-3">Yo 1.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:58">8.58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:5">17.5</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Ko 8.6</ref></char></note>, nu puroyai. Nue kakati xokupa sapi ati purineri xirini atineri saina tirouneri. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:23">YT 26.23</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Ko 15.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:23">15.23</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:10">Ep 1.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">1.22-23</ref>;<ref loc="REV 1:5">XKY 1.5</ref></char></note> tapaxina Yesusure xonikisuneri tairouneri xuiapu yakunikirouna xati, nini paiya nukou mupokemu. Nu paiya ninipo ekenikioma xotapa. Akerina kopa upuropu xiyeri saroyai apu nuko, pa xati nukoini xokupa sapi tapatapaxi puropina. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:16">Yo 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:34">3.34</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:9">Kl 2.9</ref></char></note> pa Nono xosa nukou xokupa ekeoma xeika kapia xeika puropinaure xina, pa xati Xoiteu nukoini nu xosa xiri xokopexina. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>Kakina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:1">Ro 5.1</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 5:18">2 Ko 5.18</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ep 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:10">1.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:13">2.13</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:16">2.16</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 2:2">1 Yo 2.2</ref></char></note> Xoiteue nu xeika xokupa sapi xeika xokumo iyarepurexetai, paiya ouropu sapi xeika mena xouropu sapi xeika rania kakepina. Pa xati Kristusu wetati na nikitoto xosa xumati, nupo yawi kusawati, pa kapiae Xoiteue sinipo xiwai kapia ororetai.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Tini ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:10">Ro 5.10</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:12">Ep 2.12</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:18">4.18</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 1:15-16">Ta 1.15-16</ref></char></note> Xoiteu nutiemu puropu xuwe. Tinipo nanunanue, nu xiwaixiwainuku, xoxixoxi kapia tepi saina tikiriai. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:14-16">Ep 2.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:27">5.27</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:7">1 Ts 4.7</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 2:14">Ta 2.14</ref></char></note> Kristusue na nikitoto xosa xumotai xati, pa kapiarei Xoiteue tini nu xeika xotiki tumaretai. Nukou ekero tini Xoiteupo xuiapu sieni purinari muputiki teteiwoki purinari xu xuweu purakuai xati, tini nuko xosa sotiki kopure nu kaketai. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mk 16.15</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:17">Ep 3.17</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 3:16">1 Ti 3.16</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 3:14">Ip 3.14</ref></char></note> sikou asinaku kunaure kasikekeyai sie tini tinipo xotikisu xosauni kutu puropi puropinari, atapu xai sie sokisoki tumuwaria kire sapie pa asinaku sokisoki kuna yaku purikiriaire tini purutikepuwatixe. Ye Polu ye mua asinaku kunapu saina apu saitiai xati, sinie mua ouro puroteneai xuiapu xosa kuna uteikiriai.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Kolosi kini tianiketai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Ximine<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:3">Ro 5.3</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 1:5-6">2 Ko 1.5-6</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ep 1.23</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:13">3.13</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:10">Pl 3.10</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:8">2 Ti 1.8</ref></char></note> tini tianitikepure tatau xemeropi nimaririne. Ye Yesusure xonikisuwoteai xuiapu tianikepurexine. Nini nukou mupokemuni. Kristusue Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu tianikepure tatau xemerotai paiya xuwe xatixe. Paina ikoe ikou mupi xosa xemetiai tatau paiya, Kristusupo tatau xousokuwopure ye kakitiai. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:2">Ep 3.2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:7-8">3.7-8</ref></char></note> nukoini ye tumuyerati tini tianitikepure Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai nikau saina apu xitiai. Pa xati ye Xoiteupo xokupa kuna atinei uteiwopine saina tuku. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25-26">Ro 16.25-26</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 2:7">1 Ko 2.7</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:3-5">Ep 3.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:9-10">3.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:10">2 Ti 1.10</ref></char></note> xokupa yause paiya mua kuna ximiaki purati, paire xokupa xuiapu kinie sipawopu xuwe. Pana muaia Xoiteupo xuiapu ekinikiro yarani putawotai. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:23">Ro 9.23</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 2:14">2 Ko 2.14</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:18">Ep 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:8">3.8</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 1:1">1 Ti 1.1</ref></char></note> nukou xouweni kakina, mua ximiaropu kuna sini nukou xuiapu atarisikatia, sini sipaunuku, mua kuna xiri asinaku xati paie xokupa xetau xuiapu kini tianikepina xepu. Mua ximiaropu kuna paiya muai. Kristusue tini xopu purinana, sotiki xowati nuko xeika purinari nukou asinaku asinaku sapi mena xouro purotai takuaire nu yakuwa. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:13">Ep 4.13</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:27">5.27</ref></char></note> xokupa kireni kireni apu xosa Kristusupo asinaku kuna uteirounuku. Sinie asinaku nanunanu xeika sipa xeika tainuku taitainikinuku sokisoki kuna tinikirounuku, pa amure, ninie Kristusu sokisoki taiwopinerire xinukuna, nini kakineria Xoiteu xosa xowopineri. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:20">YT 20.20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:27">20.27</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:7">Ep 3.7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:20">3.20</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:13">Pl 4.13</ref></char></note> Kristusue xokupa kokaipa sokisoki ye sirouna xati, mua saina tepure ye xiri irereiroune.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Sini xosikisuwopi xiri sokisokinuku xoreixorei kuna sokau porowopu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Tini sipawakuaire xine, yei tini xeika Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu Laotisia erewese puroteneai xeika kireu xokupa xuiapue yeu moaikemu xekopu xuweuwoteneai xeika tianitikepure ye ere irerei saina tiroune. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:6">2 Ko 1.6</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:4">Ep 3.4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:18">3.18</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:8">Pl 3.8</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:26">Kl 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:14">3.14</ref></char></note> xokupa tikau xotikikemu sokisokinei saitikeriti Xoiteupo kireu xuiapu xiri xotikienikinari nini xeika xotikikemu xiri tumaxinari purakuaire ye mua saina tiroune. Tini asinaku nanunanu tari, paie tinipo xotikisu sokisokixepinaxine. Pa xati tinie Xoiteupo ximiaropu kuna xotapa ati sipawakuaire xine. Kristusu nukoini mua ximiaropu kuna xotapa. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Xe xitam ata xosa xokopexetai sie, xokupa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:3">Ais 45.3</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:24">1 Ko 1.24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:30">1.30</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:8">Ep 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:19">3.19</ref></char></note> ximiaropu sipa xeika nanunanu xeikae Kristusu xosa xokopexina.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Kire apue tini niraniratikina xoreitikepi ye xiraxine<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Ro 16.18</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:14">Ep 4.14</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:6">5.6</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:8">Kl 2.8</ref></char></note>, pa xati ye mua kuna kunaune. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:3">1 Ko 5.3</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 14:40">14.40</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:9">1 Pi 5.9</ref></char></note> tini xeika purixana xuwe. Pana yeu nanunanu paiya, ye tini xeika purieune xeketikitia tini kutuni saina tinuku Kristusu xosa sokisoki xotikisuwari ye nimaririne.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sini Kristusu xeika etokinuku ekisikiomani kutu tepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Tinie Kokaipa Kristusu Yesusu tieikiriai, pa xati tini nu xeikani texa. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:20-22">Ep 2.20-22</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:17">3.17</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:23">Kl 1.23</ref></char></note> nae ou xosa sokisoki tumuwati, atae sokisoki xai xouro sokisoki tumuwotai sie, tini nu xosa sokisoki tumuwa. Tini sinie pa asinaku kuna taitaitikiniai xosa sokisoki xotikisunari, sipesi Xoiteu xosa eiyasewa.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:3">Ka 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:9">4.9</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ep 5.6</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:3">Kl 2.3</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:18-20">2.18-20</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:9">Ip 13.9</ref></char></note> sosopa epixakuai, panumu kire apue aipu xoreixorei sipa xeika kuna xeika tini xosa uteiwati tinie nupo nanunanu taiwaku. Panumu apimie asinikimana nikau nanunanu tineri mena xeika ou xeika yakuwoteneai yaniyani nikau nanunanu teteneai. Ninie Kristusupo nanunanu tairouworixe.<verse eid="COL 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Siko<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14-16">Yo 1.14-16</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:19">Kl 1.19</ref></char></note> sipa, Kristusu nue siko apu sie sayetai xati, Xoiteupo xokupa ekeoma nu xosa xiri xokopexina. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21-22">Ep 1.21-22</ref></char></note> xokupa sapi sokisoki tuku tapaxina. Tini Kristusupo xati, Xoiteue tini ekeoma tiketai xati pa ekeomae tini xosa xiri xokopexina. <verse eid="COL 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Ro 2.29</ref></char></note> nu xeika etokikiriai xati, mari takepi kapiani kutu tinie tikiriai. Paiya mupusikipo sapixe. Xuwe. Kristusupo kapia xosa sini xipiki xosikikemupo kapia xesauweikiriai. Mari takepi kapia paiya paini kutu. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Ro 6.4</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:19-20">Ep 1.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:7">3.7</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:1">Kl 3.1</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo wenumurei ene isikiriai yause xosa, tinie Kristusu xeika etokari, Xoiteue kopa upuro Kristusu xeika upuaitiketai. Xoiteue Kristusu kopa upuropu sarepure saina teyaire tini xotikisunuku, ene isikiriai yause xosa tini Xoiteue Kristusu xeika xiyeri saitikeretai. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Ep 2.1-5</ref></char></note> ekime xoxixoxi kapia kakinuku, xipiki xotikikemupo kapia tairouwari, paie outikiati xumukiriai. Pana Xoiteue kakati Kristusu xeika ekitikioma tari, Xoiteue sikou xokupa xu weterisikeyai. <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>Mosesipo tuxotapae<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:14-16">Ep 2.14-16</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pi 2.24</ref></char></note> kuna xosa tumusikerina sikou xokupa xu yararina kakati, sikoe nupo xokupa kuna xeika sokisoki xeika irue purikiriai. Pana Xoiteue kuna xosa iyaisikerepure xeteneai pa xokupa kuna xesauweina nue tuxotapapu sokisoki xuweiyeina Kristusupo na nikitoto xosa wareyai. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:13">Kl 1.13</ref></char></note> sokisoki yaniyani xeika xokupa konikoni sapi sokisoki tuku xeika nikau sokisoki xuweiyetai. Xoiteue na nikitoto xosa xokupa apimi ipaki atarinikina pa xokupa sapi emeserinikiati ninie aipu sapi sieiyeteneai.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sini Kristusu xeika xumuweikiriai xati panumu tu xana tue sini tianisikepuworixe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-12">Ro 14.1-12</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 8:8">1 Ko 8.8</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 4:10">Ka 4.10</ref></char></note> tini kakixari kire apu wetari kuna xosatiki suna kunauna, tini xoye xeika ene xeika nepi tuxotapa taiwarixe xina, muris tepire kokaipa asaupo tuxotapa taiwarixe oma poitaure muris tepi tuxotapa taiwarixe Yuta nikau arikepi yausepu tuxotapa taiwarixe xina kunawoxete. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:5">Ip 8.5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:9">9.9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:1">10.1</ref></char></note> xokupa kapia paiya nini aipu xeniroroi sapi sie xurise putawopure xeteneai. Pana Kristusu nuko paiya xiri asinaku. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Kire apue xiniwepirei xekotai sapire kuna utei kunauna tini takipo wenitiki ororinari xenikorokoro xosa muris ta xatia, tini kakixanari nu wetari tini oroitikexete. Panumu apimie xipiki xonikikemupo nanunanu taineri siko kireni asinaku sipani tuku xineri, <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>sikou<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:21">Ep 2.21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:15-16">4.15-16</ref></char></note> akerekini kutu Kristusu sokisoki tirouworixe. Pa tapae nukou mupo masa xokupa xosa xoye tinikati, paie xokupa muporopu tuni murie tumaxina atina xiri sokisokixirouna sie Xoiteue xouweouna.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:3-5">Ka 4.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:9">4.9</ref></char></note> Kristusu xeika xumuweikiriai xati yaniyanie mena xouropu sapi xeika ouropu xeika yakurouneri nikau sokisoki irue purarixe. Pa xati muaia tini amakati ouropu apimi sie purirounukuna? Panumu tinie panumu tuxotapa tainuku, <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>“Ne<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:3">1 Ti 4.3</ref></char></note> kakixanau teu, ne kakixanau kireu xoye neu, ne nu wetau mupuniro erarawoxete,” xirounuku. <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Panumu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Ais 29.13</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 15:9">Mt 15.9</ref></char></note> tuxotapae kakina kunawotaia siko saina tikiri sapauni xoxirouneri sapire kunawotai. Paiya apimi nikoini pa tuxotapa yararineri nini tainikepure taitaisiketeneai. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Suau, panumu tuxotapa paie Xoiteue xouwewotai kapia sarepinaxi ninie nanuneri, pani nanuneri sini sikou mupusiki ororinuku ou puropu xineri. Pa xati, kireu apimie nanuneri mua tuxotapae asinaku nanunanu xeika sipa xeika taineri xineri. Pa xati kireu apimie nanuneri mua tuxotapae asinaku nanunanu xeika sipa xeika taineri xineri. Pana pa tuxotapae sini tianisikineri xipiki xosikikemupo kapia xiri ororepuworixe.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Sini Kristusu xeika xiyeri sauweikiriai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Siri 110.1</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 12:36">Mk 12.36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:19">16.19</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:20">Ep 1.20</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:30">Pl 1.30</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:29">Kl 1.29</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:12">2.12</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:2">1 Ts 2.2</ref></char></note> tini Kristusu xeika saitikeretai xati, tini xouropu sapi tepureni kutu saina ta. Pa xouro wese xosa, Kristusue nukou kokemu sai xosa Xoiteupo xupo meruira misina. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mt 6.33</ref></char></note> xouropu sapireni kutu sipesi nanunanuwa. Tini ouropu sapire kakixanari nanunanuwaku. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Ro 6.2</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 5:7">2 Ko 5.7</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:14">5.14</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 2:20">Ka 2.20</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:20">Kl 2.20</ref></char></note> xumuweikiriaina, tinipo ekitikioma Kristusu xeika ximiaki purati tini Xoiteu xeika etokinuku. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Kristusu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:25">Yo 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:6">14.6</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 15:43">1 Ko 15.43</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:21">Pl 1.21</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 3:2">1 Yo 3.2</ref></char></note> nukoe tinipo ekitikioma xotapa. Nu yara putawatia, tini rania nuko xeika Xoiteupo kokaipa memeremu xeika nekei xeika xosa putawakuai.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="ms">Kristusue sikoreira purati sini oma xuiapu sainuku</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="COL 3:5-4:18">3.5—4.18</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Sini oma xuiapu sainuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Ro 6.6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:11-13">6.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:13">8.13</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:24">Ka 5.24</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:19">Ep 4.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:3-5">5.3-5</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:5">1 Ts 4.5</ref></char></note> mua ouropu xokupa kapia tinipo xotikiro puroteneaia xiri ounikiari xumuwepineri. Ye muanumu muanumu kapiaure kunaune, xuimi apimie ayaka xepi kapia xeika xunu kapia xeika, xosikikemu saroati xoxixoxi kapia kakepi kapia xeika xoirai kapia xeika kireu apimi nikau sapire ekisikie nepi kapia xeikaure kunauna. Mua ekisikie nepi kapia xeika xoirai kapia paiya xorei xoiteu xosa muris tepi kapia sie. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Apimie pa xoxixoxi kapia kakineri Xoiteupo kuna xosa xasese marouneri paiya, nini Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ep 5.6</ref></char></note> xarotinikepuwatixe. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:19-20">Ro 6.19-20</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 6:11">1 Ko 6.11</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:2">Ep 2.2</ref></char></note> tinie rania pa apimi xeika texinuku, pa xokupa kapia kakirounuku.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Ep 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:25-31">4.25-31</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:4">5.4</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 12:1">Ip 12.1</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:1">1 Pi 2.1</ref></char></note> muaia tinie pa xokupa xoxixoxi kapia xiri xesauweya, paiya makaunuku kisamairaxinuku xosikikemu xoxixoxixepi kapia, pa xeika kireu ninianikepi kapia xeika xoxixoxi xunu kuna kunawopi kapia xeika. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Ep 4.22</ref></char></note> kirenikirenie kakixanari kireu apimi nini Yesusure xonikisurouneri xoreinikaku, pa amure, tinie xipiki xotikikemupo xokupa kapia xesauweinuku, <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Stt 1.26</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 12:2">Ro 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:10">Ep 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">4.24</ref></char></note> oma saiyeikiriai. Xoiteue kakati tini oma apimi saiyari, sipesi tini xokupa asinaku sipa tikati, tini oma saiyeinuku nuko sienixinuku. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:12">Ro 10.12</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 3:28">Ka 3.28</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ep 1.23</ref></char></note> apu oma sasaikiriai paiya, sini xokupa panumu sieni panumu sieni purinuku. Sini pani nanunuku sini Kriki kinipo xepuxe sini Yuta kinipo xepuxe, sini mari takikirai xepuxe mari takepu xuwe xepuxe, sini xetauxetau kunapu xepuxe xetauxetau sanawapu xepuxe, sini aipu saina apu purinuku xepuxe sini somo purinuku xepuxe, pa amure, Kristusu kireni purina, Kristusu nukoini siko xokupa xosa purina.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sini kireu xosikienikepi kapiani kutu tepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:22">Ka 5.22</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:32">Ep 4.32</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:1">Pl 2.1</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pi 2.9</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Ep 4.2</ref></char></note>tini tumutikerati, tini nukou xuiapu purari, tini xiri xouwetikirouna. Pa xati tini muanumu kapiani kutu ta. Tini kireu apimire xiri eiyoxinari asinaku kapia nini xosa kaka. Tini takipo kapia ororinari apimi xosa yoro kapia kakinari, apimie tini xosa kapia xoreiyereri sapauni kisamairatikexete. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Kire apu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mk 11.25</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:32">Ep 4.32</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:2">5.2</ref></char></note> tini xopuropu nu kire apue nu xosa kapia xoreiyeretai xati nu xeika kuna tuku xatia, xeuxana nukoini pa xu xemena xataupo xunu weteruwopina. Kokaipae tinipo xunu weteritiketai xati, tinie rania kireu nikau xunu weterinikakuai. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Tinipo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:8-10">Ro 13.8-10</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 13:13">1 Ko 13.13</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:3">Ep 4.3</ref></char></note> xotikikemu kireu xuimiapimi xosa tinika. Pa kapiae xokupa kireu kapia emeserinikina, paie kakati kireu asinaku kapiae xirini kununu saina tineri sokisoki sairouneri. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Kristusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:13">1 Ko 12.13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:27">12.27</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:16-17">Ep 2.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:4">4.4</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:7">Pl 4.7</ref></char></note> xosikikemu yorowopi kapia sikirouna xati sini kireni xosikikemue purikiriai, pa kapiae tinipo xotikikemuni kutu yakuwopina. Tini kirenini xotikikemu sainari kireni xotikikemu kutu purakuaire Xoiteue yaitikeyai. Pa xati tini sipesi Xoiteu eiyasewa. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:26">1 Ko 14.26</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:19">Ep 5.19</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:6">Kl 4.6</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Ep 5.19-20</ref></char></note>Kristusupo kuna wetari tinipo xotikiro sokisoki puropina. Tini kireni kirenie Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai kireu xuiapu taitainikinari asinaku nanunanu xeika sipa xeika tinikari, asinaku kapia kireni kakepineri. Tini tinipo xotikirei Xoiteu eiyaseunari, Siri Nakaupo xeika kireu siri muris xosaupo xeika Xoiteupo Supo Youyae xotikiro iyaretai xeika sipesi worakuai. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Tinipo kuna xosa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:31">1 Ko 10.31</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:20">Ep 5.20</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:18">1 Ts 5.18</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:15">Ip 13.15</ref></char></note> xeika saina xosa xeika xokupa sapi xeika kakikiriaia, tini Kokaipa Yesusu wenumurei kakakuai. Kakinari nupo wenumurei tini Emisiki Xoiteu eiyasewakuai.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apue iya xeika nonomi xeika ati misepinerire Polue kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Ep 5.22</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 2:5">Ta 2.5</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pi 3.1</ref></char></note> xuimi, tini takipo xamutikimana irue pura. Kokaipapu ekero pa kapia xiri asinakuni kutu. <verse eid="COL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:31">Ep 4.31</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:25">5.25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:28">5.28</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pi 3.7</ref></char></note> apimi, tini takipo inetikimana xiri xotikienikinari, peuni ati yakunepu kapia kaka.<verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:24">Ep 5.24</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:1">6.1</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 2:9">Ta 2.9</ref></char></note> nonomi, tini xokupa sapire takipo emitikimana anitikimana nikau kuna taiwa. Kokaipae panumu kapia xouweurouna. <verse eid="COL 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Ep 6.4</ref></char></note> eminikimana, tinipo nonomie makawopineri kapia kakaku, panumua xonikemu xoxixoxixati kuna iyesepu xuweuwopineri.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue aipu saina apimi xeika ninipo yayakunikepi xeikaure kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:1">1 Ti 6.1</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 2:9">Ta 2.9</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Ep 6.5-8</ref></char></note>aipu saina apimi paiya tinipo yayakutikepi nikau xokupa kuna taiwakuai. Ninie tini nutietiki purori ai niraniranikepure nanuworinari asinaku saina taku. Xuwe. Tini Kokaipaureni kutu xiri ximikinari, tini asinaku saina takuaire kireni sipesi nanuwa. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Xokupa sapi kakinaria, tini sokisokinari saina takuai. Tini apu nikau saina kireni tinarixe. Xuwe. Tini Kokaipapu saina xeika tinuku. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:22">1 Ko 7.22</ref></char></note> sipa, Kokaipae sewai tini isayatikepina, paiya asinaku asinaku sapi nukou xuiapu nikau akituworiniketai tinikepina. Nanuwa. Tini Kokaipa Kristusupo saina apimi purinuku. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Apue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Tu 10.17</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 2:11">Ro 2.11</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 6:9">Ep 6.9</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:17">1 Pi 1.17</ref></char></note> kapia xoreiyerina paiya, nu xoreiyeretaipo xu xapa tepina. Xoiteue xokupa xuiapu nikau kapia kireni imereini uteirouna.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:43">XS 25.43</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:53">25.53</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 6:9">Ep 6.9</ref></char></note> aipu saina apimi nikau yayakunikepi, tinipo aipu saina apimi xosa tini asinaku kapiani kutu kakakuai. Tini sipa, taki rania tini yayakutikepi tuku nu mena xouro purina.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sini kunikuniwopi kapia sokisoki tainuku kutuni texepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:18">Ep 6.18</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:6">Pl 4.6</ref></char></note> kunikuniwopi kapia sokisoki takuai. Tini kunikuniwakuai yause paiya, tini ati nanunanu tinari Xoiteu eiyasewakuai. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:30">Ro 15.30</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 16:9">1 Ko 16.9</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 6:19">Ep 6.19</ref></char></note> kunikuninaria Xoiteue sini rania tianisikepinaure kunikuniwakuai. Sini Kristusupo kuna uteiwopinukure tinie kotowari ime taiyerisikepina. Mua kuna paiya ekime ximiaki puroyaie, ximine yarani putawotai. Pana apimie pa kuna iyesepu xirarineri kakauya xosa iyaiyereteneai. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Yei mua kuna ati uteiwopineure Xoiteue xouweyetai xati, tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:20">Ep 6.20</ref></char></note> paire kunikuniwakuai.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:15-16">Ep 5.15-16</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:11-12">1 Ts 4.11-12</ref></char></note> Yesusure xonikisuwopu xuweuwoteneai xuimiapimi xeika purinaria tini asinaku nanunanu tainari asinaku kapiani kutu taiwakuai. Nini xokupa yause Kristusupo kapia atarinikepure tini ireiwakuai. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9.50</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:29">Ep 4.29</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:16">Kl 3.16</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:15">1 Pi 3.15</ref></char></note> sipesi kunaunari paiya, apimie iyesineri xonikieurouneri kuna kireni kunawakuai. Tini atinari nanunanu tinari xokupa apimi nikau kuna xaute atinari xonikemu tepina kuna xapa kanikakuai.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Tikikusuno Onesimusuno xesanikati Kolosi xowoxeteneai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Yei xokupa saina kakitiaire paiya Tikikusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">YT 20.4</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Ti 4.12</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Ep 6.21-22</ref></char></note>tini katikepina. Tikikusu nu sikou xatasikini kutu nu sikou saina emesiki, nu Kokaipapu asinaku aipu saina apuni kutu. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Ye pa xotapaure kireni xesauti tini xosa utuna, paiya sini amaki purikiriai sipawakuaire, pa xeika tinipo xotikikemu sokisokiwopinaure utuna. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Pm 10-12</ref></char></note> Onesimusino Tikikusuno xeika xesanikiti utunexeri. Onesimusi nu sikou xatasikini kutu, nu sikou saina emisiki, pa xeika nu takipo kuna emetiki. Ninie xokupa kapia muoro yaraxetaire katikepineri.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue Kolosi kini kuso kuna xesariniketai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Aristakusi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">YT 12.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:25">12.25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19.29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27.2</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pm 24</ref></char></note>, nu ye xeika kakauya xosa purina, nue tini kusotikina. Maki paiya, nu Parnapasipo xepeu, nue rania tini kusotikina. Ye kuna xesaritikine katikiyaia nure katikiyaina, nu tini xosa utatia, tinie nimaririrei sowakuai. <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Kire Yesusu, wenuneri Yastusu xeteneai, nue rania tini kusotikina. Yuta kini xosaupo apimi nini pa apimi kirenie ye xiri atineri taineri Xoiteue xuiapu yakunikirouna yause sarepure saina tirouneri. Ninie ye atineri tianirouneri.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Epaprasi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Kl 1.7</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pm 23</ref></char></note> nue tini kusotikina. Nu takipo xatatiki, nu Kristusu Yesusupo saina apu. Tinie Xoiteupo kapia tieinuku xouropu Xoiteupo xokupa nanunanu atinuku xiri sipauwekiriai xati, tini sokisoki tumuwakuaire nue sipesi sokisoki kunikunina Xoiteue tianitikepinaure kotourouna. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Ye nure tini katikepurexine, nue tini xeika Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuimiapimi Laotisia erewesepu xeika Ieropolis erewesepu xeika puroteneai xosa tianitikepure xiri irereina saina tirouna. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Apu Luku<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 Ti 4.10-11</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pm 24</ref></char></note>, pa sipetuaure sini xiri xosikieurounuku, nue Temasino tini kusotikineri.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Tinie yeu kuso Laotisia erewese puroteneai xatasikimana tinikakuaire ye xoieune. Pani Nimpa xeika Yesusure xonikisurouneri xuiapue nupo atoro kununurouneri rania yeu kusotinika. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Tinie mua nakau ninaiyeinaria, Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu Laotisia puroteneai xosa xesarinikari, ninie rania ninaxepineri. Tinie rania, ye Laotisia xesauti xowotai nakau ninaxakuai. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Pm 2</ref></char></note> Arkipusi ipaki kaunaria, “Ne Kokaipa xosaupo tiyai saina ati yakunau, pa saina atinauni kutu kake,” xi kawakuai.<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">1 Ko 16.21</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 3:17">2 Ts 3.17</ref></char></note> Polu, ye ikoini mua kuso kuna tini xosa xayaune. Tini yeureni nanunanuwa, ye kakauyaroni purine. Xoiteue xouwesikina xoukemu sikirouna kapia tini xosa purina.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
